==English==

===Etymology===
{{etyl|la|en}} ''[[inseminatus]]'', past participle of ''[[inseminare]]'' to sow.  See [[seminate]].

===Verb===
{{en-verb|inseminat|ing}}

# To [[sow]] (to disperse or plant seeds).
# To [[impregnate]] (to cause to become pregnant).

